From f55dec8f4ee12de8e35160b62cc4004cca6bfa02 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ljhhkx529 <ljhzyx520@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 18:29:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 14/15] payload: refuse a Data seed whose volume UUID is not
 the one the kernel was built for

Persistent storage does not make the seed interchangeable: the native block
provider publishes the APFS volume by the UUID compiled into the kernel. A seed
with another UUID is written and then never published, which looks like a
storage fault on the device.

For packed DBRDISK1 inputs the UUID is available without mounting the image,
so the mismatched pair is rejected before the payload is written. The kernel's
own value comes from CONFIG_XNU_OWNER_DATA_VOLUME_UUID.

The GPU addon gets the same treatment: a kernel that asks for sheng-gpu-addon=1
must have its user-space payload with it. The kernel-side Adreno bring-up can
retire its self-test fences without the addon, so a kernel-only payload looks
healthy until SpringBoard asks for Metal. The boot argument is treated as an
input contract, and a payload with the plugin or its owner trust cache omitted
never reaches bootimg.
---
 docs/concepts/payload.md       |  9 +++++++
 docs/zh/concepts/payload.md    |  9 +++++++
 scripts/test-runtime-inputs.py | 27 +++++++++++++++++--
 scripts/unixnu/payload.py      | 47 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 4 files changed, 84 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/concepts/payload.md b/docs/concepts/payload.md
index c485524..78442e6 100644
--- a/docs/concepts/payload.md
+++ b/docs/concepts/payload.md
@@ -101,6 +101,10 @@ The bundle is copied into the kernel window and its address and size replace the
 
 An `--owner-trust-cache` bundle is copied without the `[payload] trust_cache_sha256` check. It carries the original caches and extra modules such as the GPU plugin.
 
+When the effective kernel command line contains `sheng-gpu-addon=1`, both `--gpu-addon` and `--owner-trust-cache` are mandatory.
+The payload build fails if either is missing. Kernel-side Adreno self-tests can otherwise pass while the user-space Metal plugin is
+absent, producing a deceptively bootable image with no usable Metal path.
+
 ## Data ramdisk
 
 When the selected kernel configuration enables `CONFIG_XNU_OWNER_DATA_MOUNT`,
@@ -119,6 +123,11 @@ A Data seed can be delivered in two forms:
 
 The packed form carries a header with the magic `DBRDISK1`, version 1, the page size, the expanded size and an extent table of `(offset, length)` pairs. Omitted ranges are zeroed RAM.
 
+When `CONFIG_XNU_OWNER_DATA_MOUNT` and `[payload.adt] packed_data_ramdisk` are enabled,
+the payload builder also reads the APFS volume UUID from the packed seed. It refuses to
+write a payload when that UUID differs from `CONFIG_XNU_OWNER_DATA_VOLUME_UUID`; a
+persistent overlay still has to be published through the preserved matching seed.
+
 `scripts/seed-data-grow.py` grows a packed seed to the tablet's storage. The kernel accepts a Data disk of up to 1 TiB, and above 2 GiB the typed provider keeps only the nonzero pages of the seed.
 
 ## Determinism
diff --git a/docs/zh/concepts/payload.md b/docs/zh/concepts/payload.md
index b6bac22..7f9aa88 100644
--- a/docs/zh/concepts/payload.md
+++ b/docs/zh/concepts/payload.md
@@ -106,6 +106,10 @@ DarwinBoot 校验 trust cache 包：
 
 `--owner-trust-cache` 包不经过 `[payload] trust_cache_sha256` 校验。它携带原始缓存和 GPU 插件等额外模块。
 
+当最终内核命令行包含 `sheng-gpu-addon=1` 时，必须同时提供 `--gpu-addon` 和 `--owner-trust-cache`，缺少任意一项都会让
+payload 构建直接失败。否则内核侧 Adreno 自检仍可能通过，但用户态 Metal 插件并不存在，从而生成一个看似能启动、实际没有
+可用 Metal 路径的镜像。
+
 ## Data ramdisk
 
 Data 种子有两种交付形式：
@@ -117,6 +121,11 @@ Data 种子有两种交付形式：
 
 Packed 形式包含 magic `DBRDISK1`、版本 1、页大小、展开大小和 `(offset, length)` extent 表。未列出的范围是零填充 RAM。
 
+启用 `CONFIG_XNU_OWNER_DATA_MOUNT` 和 `[payload.adt] packed_data_ramdisk` 时，
+payload 构建器还会读取 packed seed 内的 APFS 卷 UUID。若它与
+`CONFIG_XNU_OWNER_DATA_VOLUME_UUID` 不同，构建会在写入 payload 前失败；即使使用持久化
+overlay，也必须继续提供与内核匹配的原始 seed 来发布该卷。
+
 `scripts/seed-data-grow.py` 把 packed 种子增长到平板的存储大小。内核接受最大 1 TiB 的 Data 磁盘，超过 2 GiB 时 typed provider 只保存种子的非零页。
 
